class Solution { private int gcd(int a,int b){while(b!=0){int temporary=a%b;a=b;b=temporary;}return a;}public List<Integer> replaceNonCoprimes(int[] nums){List<Integer> stack=new ArrayList<>();for(int value:nums){while(!stack.isEmpty()){int top=stack.get(stack.size()-1),divisor=gcd(top,value);if(divisor==1)break;stack.remove(stack.size()-1);value=(int)((long)top/divisor*value);}stack.add(value);}return stack;} }
